Inertia Blast: the keys
=======================

In the game (the keys can be changed with C on the title screen):

  A             turn left
  S             turn right
  Right Shift   thrust
  Return        fire
  Space         pick up the pod, and the shield

  P             pause            C   go on
  Esc or Q      end the game

On the title screen: I instructions, C configure the keys, H high
scores, P play, A about, Q quit.

The keys every AmiCradle game has on Right Amiga (GFOpenUp's SDL2.module):
Right Amiga + F window or full screen, + P pause, + Q quit, + M free the
mouse pointer, + S a screenshot in the drawer's Screenshots, and Help
shows this file.
